<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 103.52 to 6961.63, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 5.79 to 419.88, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.60.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1757 to 758.</p>
<p>Volume was 563,552,340 compared with 480,590,220 on Tuesday.</p>
